wrote /private/tmp/ouro-w12b-keygen/signer.key (mode 0600)

On the signer node — and nowhere else — the private half:
  OUROBOROS_SIGNER_KEY_PATH=/private/tmp/ouro-w12b-keygen/signer.key
  OUROBOROS_SIGNER_ID=w12-keygen-fixture

On every core node that must accept what it signs — the public half:
  OUROBOROS_UPGRADE_TRUSTED_SIGNERS=w12-keygen-fixture:6kWLUmltrxnGIJr+x3wNUoDgNIOqMwgNVj34ywGHcrs=

The seed never leaves the signer. A core node needs only the line above it; anyone holding the file can sign as this identity.
